CommentsService — 1.1.0.1 Init
Branch: CommentsService/v_1.1.0.1_Init

ENGLISH
Initial .NET 10 / React skeleton. No comment functionality, database or Docker yet.
Requirements: .NET SDK 10, Node.js 24 and npm.
Build from repository root:
  dotnet build src/CommentsService.Api -c Release
  npm --prefix src/comments-web ci
  npm --prefix src/comments-web run build
Run in separate terminals:
  dotnet run --project src/CommentsService.Api --no-launch-profile --urls http://127.0.0.1:5081
  npm --prefix src/comments-web run dev
Open: http://localhost:5174
Full English instructions: README.md. Russian: README.RU.md. Ukrainian: README.UA.md.
History: change.log. Planned iterations: docs/PLAN.md.

